    "transcript": [
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 58989,
            "text": "Hey there, good to have you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 70787,
            "end": 82584,
            "text": "Hi, sorry if I am a minute behind, glad to be here now."
          },
          {
            "start": 82585,
            "end": 106180,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for having us, ready when you are."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 117978,
            "end": 129775,
            "text": "That sounds manageable, let's take these one at a time."
          },
          {
            "start": 129776,
            "end": 153371,
            "text": "Sounds good, I have some time blocked so we can cover everything."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 171067,
            "end": 188764,
            "text": "Nothing major on our end generally, just a couple of specific items."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 200562,
            "end": 218258,
            "text": "Let's get into it, what would you like to start with?"
          },
          {
            "start": 218259,
            "end": 235955,
            "text": "I pulled up your account beforehand, so we should be able to move through this."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 241854,
            "end": 294944,
            "text": "Staff who move departments still show up with their prior access weeks later because the provisioning sync does not pick up the role change."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 312640,
            "end": 359831,
            "text": "One of our regional coordinators moved roles in July and kept her prior permissions for almost six weeks before IT caught it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 377528,
            "end": 424719,
            "text": "Appreciate that, let me confirm one thing before we continue."
          },
          {
            "start": 424720,
            "end": 442416,
            "text": "How long did it take before anyone noticed the access had not updated?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 448315,
            "end": 466011,
            "text": "Close to six weeks, until she tried to approve something she should not have had access to."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 477809,
            "end": 501404,
            "text": "Switching gears for a second, anything else going on that I should know about?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 519101,
            "end": 572191,
            "text": "We are getting the renewal notices ready to go out in the next couple of weeks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 583989,
            "end": 595787,
            "text": "Glad to hear the renewal cycle is moving along smoothly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 613483,
            "end": 654775,
            "text": "It has been a season of change with a few new faces around."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 672472,
            "end": 713764,
            "text": "Turnover can be tough, glad the team is adapting."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 719663,
            "end": 755056,
            "text": "We send a short renewal survey out once the cycle wraps up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 766854,
            "end": 814045,
            "text": "Nice to hear the numbers are holding steady."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 825843,
            "end": 884831,
            "text": "We are down a person on the finance team right now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 902528,
            "end": 926124,
            "text": "Appreciate you letting us know, we can adjust support as needed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 943820,
            "end": 985112,
            "text": "Most of our members renew online now instead of mailing anything in."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 996910,
            "end": 1038202,
            "text": "That timing lines up with what we typically see this time of year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1055899,
            "end": 1067697,
            "text": "A couple of part time staff moved into full time roles."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1073596,
            "end": 1114888,
            "text": "That is a big shift, let us know if training support would help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1126685,
            "end": 1162079,
            "text": "We just wrapped a round of renewal follow up calls last week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1179775,
            "end": 1209270,
            "text": "Renewal season can be a lot, glad the team is staying on top of it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1215169,
            "end": 1250562,
            "text": "We are training a new hire on our systems this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1268258,
            "end": 1327247,
            "text": "Sounds like a busy stretch for the team, hope it eases up soon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1344944,
            "end": 1374438,
            "text": "The team has been tracking renewal numbers pretty closely this quarter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1380337,
            "end": 1439326,
            "text": "Good timing on the reminders, that usually helps with response rates."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1445225,
            "end": 1451124,
            "text": "One of our longtime staff members retired recently."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1468820,
            "end": 1516011,
            "text": "Sounds like a lot of change, hope the transition goes smoothly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1521910,
            "end": 1569101,
            "text": "We have been fielding a steady stream of renewal questions lately."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1580899,
            "end": 1633989,
            "text": "Good to know which accounts you are watching, flag if we can help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1639888,
            "end": 1657584,
            "text": "We just brought on a new coordinator last month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1669382,
            "end": 1681180,
            "text": "Sorry to hear about the departure, hope the backfill goes quickly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1698876,
            "end": 1716573,
            "text": "Our renewal reminders go out about six weeks before the anniversary date."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1722472,
            "end": 1746067,
            "text": "Good to know, I will keep that in mind for the account review."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1763764,
            "end": 1781461,
            "text": "We have had a bit of turnover on our team this quarter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1787360,
            "end": 1822753,
            "text": "Hope the reorg settles in without too much disruption."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1834551,
            "end": 1887640,
            "text": "Our renewal rate has held pretty steady compared to last cycle."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1905337,
            "end": 1911236,
            "text": "Makes sense, we see that pattern with a lot of accounts your size."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1923034,
            "end": 1952528,
            "text": "A few staff shifted departments after our reorg."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1970225,
            "end": 1987921,
            "text": "Good to hear you found someone for the new hire."
